Backport the daemon-side disconnected-client logging fix from Nix:
https://github.com/NixOS/nix/commit/137096350b68d39b6f66f126b1d79963a03fff4e

A logging write after client cancellation can throw during coroutine
cleanup and abort the worker before its builder and sandbox are cleaned up.
Keep this daemon-only backport compatible with Nix 2.35's Logger interface.

